  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be two events such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>. Consider&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math>. Then</p>",
