  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be two events such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Now using the formula of conditional probability we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now again using formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>{also <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are true.</p></blockquote>",
